Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.60,0:00:20.44,Default,,0,0,0,,We share the music.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.52,0:00:22.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, let's go, baby, baby.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.12,0:00:23.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, we share the one dream.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.42,0:00:26.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, let's go, everybody.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.26,0:00:27.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, we share the good times.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.38,0:00:28.46,Default,,0,0,0,,We share the good times.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.54,0:00:31.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go, baby, baby, oh,\Nwe share the one world?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.50,0:00:33.70,Default,,0,0,0,,It's hard to see for you and me!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.78,0:00:35.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Through the darkness\Nthat is in this world.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.80,0:00:37.66,Default,,0,0,0,,So hard to see, but to believe!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.74,0:00:39.46,Default,,0,0,0,,In where we need to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.54,0:00:43.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, you and me, it's true that we\NFeel the rush brought on by this world.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.80,0:00:45.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Through head to feet, I feel the beat!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.80,0:00:47.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Getting me to walk on, oh yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.52,0:00:49.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Share the music, no matter what.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.90,0:00:51.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Share the one dream, believe in yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.00,0:00:53.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Share the good times, take my hand now.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.96,0:00:55.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Share the one world now!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.44,0:00:57.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I look up to the stars.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.62,0:00:59.24,Default,,0,0,0,,And reach for the sky.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.32,0:01:01.32,Default,,0,0,0,,No matter what!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.40,0:01:03.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll try no matter how high!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.78,0:01:05.48,Default,,0,0,0,,So let us go!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.56,0:01:07.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Beyond, far and wide!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.42,0:01:09.32,Default,,0,0,0,,I believe in tomorrow!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.40,0:01:10.72,Default,,0,0,0,,If we try high!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.90,0:01:13.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah. Yeah. Yeah. Yeah. Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.02,0:01:15.82,Default,,0,0,0,,C'mon, let's go, everybody!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.90,0:01:17.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh we share the music!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.24,0:01:19.86,Default,,0,0,0,,C'mon, let's go, baby, baby!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.94,0:01:21.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh we share the one world!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.56,0:01:23.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh as we chase we're being chased!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.90,0:01:25.76,Default,,0,0,0,,From the top we go on straight and wild!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.84,0:01:27.74,Default,,0,0,0,,We're on our way. I've got to say!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.82,0:01:29.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, I want to share your style!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.52,0:01:31.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Now here it starts, so don't lose heart!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.76,0:01:33.60,Default,,0,0,0,,They're bound to lose to this flavor!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.68,0:01:35.62,Default,,0,0,0,,From boot to hood, I feel so good!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.70,0:01:37.40,Default,,0,0,0,,I will be free to be, oh yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.48,0:01:41.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Share the music, even if I Share\Nthe one dream, I know where you are!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.96,0:01:45.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Share the good times,\Nshare the one world now!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.44,0:01:47.48,Default,,0,0,0,,I look up to the stars.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.56,0:01:49.34,Default,,0,0,0,,And reach for the sky.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.42,0:01:51.32,Default,,0,0,0,,No matter what!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.40,0:01:53.68,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll try no matter how high!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.76,0:01:55.38,Default,,0,0,0,,So let us go!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.46,0:01:57.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Beyond, far and wide!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.42,0:01:59.32,Default,,0,0,0,,I believe in tomorrow!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.40,0:02:00.40,Default,,0,0,0,,If we try!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.76,0:02:05.40,Default,,0,0,0,,I know that you are there!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.48,0:02:07.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Just on the other side!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.68,0:02:09.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait there for me!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.56,0:02:11.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Soon it will be you and I!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.80,0:02:13.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Then let us go!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.58,0:02:15.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Beyond, far and wide!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.38,0:02:17.52,Default,,0,0,0,,I believe in the one world!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.60,0:02:18.50,Default,,0,0,0,,If we try!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.94,0:02:22.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, yeah, yeah, yeah, yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.10,0:02:23.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, let's go, everybody!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.96,0:02:25.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, we share the music!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.86,0:02:27.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, let's go, maybe, maybe!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.94,0:02:29.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, we share the one world!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.56,0:03:03.52,Default,,0,0,0,,G-Galos!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.26,0:03:10.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry, everybody.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.62,0:03:12.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Now that I've punched this guy,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.22,0:03:15.04,Default,,0,0,0,,there's going to be a Navy Admiral\Ncoming here with a warship.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.12,0:03:17.77,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm just pissed I didn't\Nget to cut him down.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.42,0:03:19.78,Default,,0,0,0,,You beat me to it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.08,0:03:21.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Hachi, hang in there.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.36,0:03:24.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you know how much\Ntrouble you guys are in now?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.98,0:03:28.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh, that's just Luffy.\NWhat can you do? Nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.80,0:03:32.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, that's that.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.42,0:03:33.77,Default,,0,0,0,,I guess we're fighting.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.92,0:03:36.70,Default,,0,0,0,,First off, we gotta get\Nthe key to Kami's collar.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.78,0:03:38.19,Default,,0,0,0,,It's probably backstage.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.58,0:03:41.11,Default,,0,0,0,,In the meantime, I'll\Ntend to Hachi's womb.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.42,0:03:47.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Jonas!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.60,0:03:49.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Dear brother, what have they done to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.94,0:03:54.30,Default,,0,0,0,,No one has ever laid a hand on him,\Nnot even you, father. You scum!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.50,0:03:56.62,Default,,0,0,0,,How dare you raise a hand to my son!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.16,0:04:02.88,Default,,0,0,0,,They angered the dragons Are they crazy?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.06,0:04:04.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Run for your lives!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.70,0:04:12.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Our righteous bloodline is directly\Ndescended from the creators of this world.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.04,0:04:15.06,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll suffer for your dissonance!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.14,0:04:17.44,Default,,0,0,0,,No one gives a damn who you're related to.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.52,0:04:19.22,Default,,0,0,0,,That bastard kid, St.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.32,0:04:20.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Roswell
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.36,0:04:22.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Shoo!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.64,0:04:23.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Kunkase!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.42,0:04:26.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.33,0:04:28.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Get a move on, Franky! Freak Amy!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.36,0:04:30.30,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm on it, you just leave it to me!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.38,0:04:31.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Seize them guards!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.52,0:04:32.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Capture those pirates!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.98,0:04:35.16,Default,,0,0,0,,They're responsible!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.50,0:04:39.03,Default,,0,0,0,,What kind of fool risks their\Nlives to protect a lousy fish?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.62,0:04:41.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Come back! Help!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.58,0:04:49.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Strong right!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.42,0:04:54.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Fresh fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.58,0:05:00.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Get back here!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.96,0:05:02.30,Default,,0,0,0,,No, leave me alone!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.24,0:05:13.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Armour in a storm? Not so smart.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.10,0:05:18.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Thunderbolt Chipsa!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.28,0:05:31.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.72,0:05:45.52,Default,,0,0,0,,You insist on defying us to the very end!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.86,0:05:49.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Why can't you just accept\Nyour fate? Back down!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.10,0:05:52.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Our prank isn't for sale!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.30,0:05:55.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Summon the Navy Admiral and the warships!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.40,0:05:59.32,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll make those pirates suffer!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.88,0:06:02.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Some suicidal pirate\Nhit a celestial dragon!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.74,0:06:05.44,Default,,0,0,0,,There's a warship all the way\Nfrom the Navy headquarters!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.52,0:06:07.02,Default,,0,0,0,,36 caliber Phoenix!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.58,0:06:12.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you trying to kill us?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.08,0:06:19.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Kuma!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.22,0:06:23.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Kuma! Are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.10,0:06:27.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Those creeps didn't hurt\Nyou, did they? I'm okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.40,0:06:29.56,Default,,0,0,0,,But you, that dragon shot you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.78,0:06:31.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Nothing to worry about.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.14,0:06:33.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, you ought to\Nknow me better than that.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.22,0:06:35.22,Default,,0,0,0,,No measly bullet can keep me down.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.36,0:06:36.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Just hang in there, Kuma.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.70,0:06:38.47,Default,,0,0,0,,We're getting you out of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.86,0:06:39.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.34,0:06:49.08,Default,,0,0,0,,My, we're missing the party.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.36,0:06:50.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Look at the entrance.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.50,0:06:51.58,Default,,0,0,0,,It's completely blocked.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.66,0:06:53.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Goodness, what a quandary.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.78,0:06:55.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, let's crash right through.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.70,0:06:57.08,Default,,0,0,0,,You got it. What?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.42,0:07:00.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Can't we just tiptoe in instead? Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.94,0:07:06.82,Default,,0,0,0,,My allergy to auction\Nhouses is glaring up.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.80,0:07:13.46,Default,,0,0,0,,More flying fish.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.54,0:07:15.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks a lot.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.28,0:07:17.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Best of luck. The end.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.18,0:07:18.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Wing.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.36,0:07:24.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Take care buddy.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.84,0:07:25.72,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm off.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.80,0:07:26.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Clutch.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.90,0:07:30.30,Default,,0,0,0,,It's time for.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.38,0:07:31.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Feats of fancy.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.36,0:07:32.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.40,0:07:33.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Protect the mermaid.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.74,0:07:35.94,Default,,0,0,0,,She's my 500 million future.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.02,0:07:38.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe I should just stand up here.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.50,0:07:40.38,Default,,0,0,0,,and bravely pose a while longer.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.54,0:07:41.78,Default,,0,0,0,,You're going already.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.94,0:07:46.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks for screwing up the\Ntiming of my dramatic entrance!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.96,0:07:49.22,Default,,0,0,0,,These creatures will suffer my wrath.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.48,0:07:53.77,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll step the women as trophies and\Nstarve the men for a life of slavery.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.68,0:07:58.18,Default,,0,0,0,,You crushed father!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.86,0:08:03.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, that didn't hurt that much.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.50,0:08:06.90,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm so sorry, mister.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.98,0:08:08.88,Default,,0,0,0,,They took down St. Roswald, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.08,0:08:11.61,Default,,0,0,0,,You do know warships\Nare coming, don't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.66,0:08:14.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Usopp! Brooke! Robin!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.84,0:08:17.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, you guys made it. About time.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.28,0:08:20.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Loopy, where's Kuma? Right there!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.62,0:08:24.00,Default,,0,0,0,,The thing is, we gotta get that\Ncollar off her before we can go!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.08,0:08:25.06,Default,,0,0,0,,You'd better hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.14,0:08:27.28,Default,,0,0,0,,The Navy is gonna show up any minute now!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.36,0:08:32.68,Default,,0,0,0,,I hate to tell you this, but the\NNavy's already here, Straw Hat.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.54,0:08:34.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Who the hell are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.62,0:08:36.86,Default,,0,0,0,,What's with the bear?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.98,0:08:42.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Purple you picked a bad\Ntime to revolt the navy's
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.30,0:08:44.16,Default,,0,0,0,,had this place around it\Nsince before the auction.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.24,0:08:47.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Even began they've got a\Nbase in the archipelago
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.54,0:08:51.18,Default,,0,0,0,,but i'm guessing they're\Nafter someone please.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.26,0:08:54.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Leave in a calm and orderly\Nfashion it's all right
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.46,0:08:56.98,Default,,0,0,0,,we have everything under\Ncontrol how's it look?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.06,0:08:59.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Inside we've finished\Nevacuating all of the patrons
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.36,0:09:01.74,Default,,0,0,0,,but the three celestial\Ndragons are still inside.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.82,0:09:03.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Then get him out of there!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.56,0:09:04.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn pirates!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.98,0:09:07.16,Default,,0,0,0,,You're not getting out of this alive!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.48,0:09:11.83,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know who exactly\Nthey're hoping to catch in here,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.66,0:09:15.28,Default,,0,0,0,,but I sincerely doubt they were expecting
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.36,0:09:18.18,Default,,0,0,0,,someone to go and kick a\NCelestial Dragon's ass.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.84,0:09:22.88,Default,,0,0,0,,That was a hell of a show you guys put on.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.96,0:09:24.44,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm impressed, Straw Hat.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.04,0:09:27.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, you're Trafalgar Law.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.88,0:09:30.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Luffy, they're pirates just like us.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.72,0:09:31.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.63,0:09:32.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Even the bear?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.34,0:09:39.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Please don't!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.36,0:09:41.26,Default,,0,0,0,,I beg you to stop, St. Shalria!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.66,0:09:45.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Could you maybe at least wait until\Nthe merchandise has been paid for?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.12,0:09:47.66,Default,,0,0,0,,I beg of you, please stop. Have mercy!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.88,0:09:49.22,Default,,0,0,0,,I just want to be rich!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.30,0:09:50.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Enough, commoner! Silence!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.06,0:09:55.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, crap! Kuma!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.02,0:10:00.16,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm trying to aim
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.02,0:10:15.54,Default,,0,0,0,,What? St.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.72,0:10:16.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Shaulria
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.14,0:10:49.32,Default,,0,0,0,,What did I tell you?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.60,0:10:52.60,Default,,0,0,0,,I know a ruckus when I hear one.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.82,0:10:54.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Looks like the auction's over.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.42,0:10:56.84,Default,,0,0,0,,I got the money I came here for.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.28,0:11:01.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Now guess I'll head back to the\Ngambling house and throw it all away.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.26,0:11:03.16,Default,,0,0,0,,You are one messed up old man.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.38,0:11:06.10,Default,,0,0,0,,You got locked up just\Nto steal some money?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.46,0:11:07.66,Default,,0,0,0,,That was the plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.96,0:11:11.92,Default,,0,0,0,,And if it had worked out, I was\Ngoing to rob whoever bought me, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.00,0:11:14.00,Default,,0,0,0,,But I guess it wasn't meant to be.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.58,0:11:16.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, right, I forgot I'm out.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.44,0:11:18.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Time to find some more booze.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.32,0:11:20.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Now that I think about\Nit, I'd plan stinks.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.00,0:11:24.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Who the hell would spend money on\Nan old fart like me for a slave?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.54,0:11:37.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh boy, I didn't realize we\Nhad such a captive audience.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.12,0:11:40.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Where did that old man\Nand the giant come from?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.54,0:11:43.26,Default,,0,0,0,,They were supposed to be merchandised\Nfor the auction, but they were locked up.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.34,0:11:45.81,Default,,0,0,0,,How in the heck did they get out of there?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.90,0:11:50.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Their colors were gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.24,0:11:53.01,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no way they could\Nhave gotten them off.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.30,0:11:54.22,Default,,0,0,0,,What do we do?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.42,0:11:55.58,Default,,0,0,0,,How should I know?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.76,0:11:57.52,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not our job to capture slaves,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.60,0:12:01.19,Default,,0,0,0,,and we've got no chance going\Nup against an unshackled giant.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.82,0:12:02.80,Default,,0,0,0,,R-Reilly?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.80,0:12:06.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, E-Reilly?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.22,0:12:07.10,Default,,0,0,0,,The coding mechanic?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.18,0:12:08.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Which one is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.10,0:12:10.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, is that you, Hachi? It sure is.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.04,0:12:11.94,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll be damned.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.24,0:12:14.18,Default,,0,0,0,,So, pal, what are you doing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.94,0:12:17.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Did someone hurt you?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.48,0:12:19.92,Default,,0,0,0,,No, no, don't speak.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.18,0:12:21.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Save your energy.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.50,0:12:42.98,Default,,0,0,0,,I see now, plain as day,\Na terrible situation.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.58,0:12:48.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, you were fighting for what\Nyou believe is right, Hachi.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.04,0:12:51.66,Default,,0,0,0,,You must be the good\Nfolks who stood by him.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.98,0:12:53.94,Default,,0,0,0,,All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.50,0:13:08.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Is he...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.86,0:13:09.90,Default,,0,0,0,,no way?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.44,0:13:13.00,Default,,0,0,0,,What? But how?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.24,0:13:14.65,Default,,0,0,0,,What did you do to them?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.54,0:13:17.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, who is this guy?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.50,0:13:28.76,Default,,0,0,0,,That Straw Hat you wear it suits a\Nfearless man like yourself quite well.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.36,0:13:35.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes I wanted to meet you Monkey D Luffy.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.42,0:13:46.82,Default,,0,0,0,,This is bad news. The whole town no,\Nthe whole archipelago's in trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.98,0:13:51.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Stride, Luffy just beat the\Ncrap out of a celestial dragon.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.18,0:13:53.30,Default,,0,0,0,,It happened at the auction\Nhouse over on Grove No.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.38,0:13:54.54,Default,,0,0,0,,1. No way.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.04,0:13:57.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Apparently, Captain Kidd and\NCaptain Law are there, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.50,0:13:58.96,Default,,0,0,0,,That stupid Straw Hat.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.12,0:14:00.80,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell was he thinking?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.88,0:14:02.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Doesn't he know they're\Ngoing to send an admiral
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.90,0:14:05.78,Default,,0,0,0,,over from Navy headquarters\Nwith a battleship?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.02,0:14:07.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Has our ship been coated yet?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.76,0:14:08.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Finished yesterday.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.14,0:14:10.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Then we set sail immediately.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.30,0:14:14.30,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not going to sit around\Nwaiting for an admiral to show up.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.38,0:14:15.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.82,0:14:20.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Guess they're dumbass captains an\Neven bigger dumbass than I thought.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.72,0:14:25.74,Default,,0,0,0,,If I run into them in the new\Nworld, they're dead! Dead!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.36,0:14:36.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Causing trouble with Navy headquarters\Nwith the new world right in their sights.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.84,0:14:40.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Those Straw Hats are certainly\Naudacious, if nothing else.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.02,0:14:43.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Make preparations to set sail quickly.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.66,0:14:45.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir, Captain Drake.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.16,0:14:45.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Right away.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.46,0:14:49.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoever shows up, it can't be good news.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.18,0:15:01.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Given the situation, I doubt\Nthey'll bother to arrest all of us.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.76,0:15:03.72,Default,,0,0,0,,After all, Straw Hat's the one they want.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.80,0:15:07.24,Default,,0,0,0,,And I kind of want to see what\Nan animal is like in action.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.32,0:15:08.42,Default,,0,0,0,,What, you're kidding me?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.50,0:15:11.03,Default,,0,0,0,,We gotta get the hell\Nout of here now, Apu!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.94,0:15:17.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Captain Hawkins, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.66,0:15:18.84,Default,,0,0,0,,It's dangerous here.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.06,0:15:20.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's set sail immediately.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.90,0:15:22.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Calm yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.81,0:15:26.08,Default,,0,0,0,,After all, I am not\Ndestined to die on this day.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.32,0:15:32.68,Default,,0,0,0,,That brat again.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.98,0:15:34.76,Default,,0,0,0,,It's just one thing after another.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.84,0:15:36.70,Default,,0,0,0,,What is wrong with that whole family?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.78,0:15:37.61,Default,,0,0,0,,They're crazy.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.80,0:15:40.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Reports indicate that along\Nwith the Straw Hat crew,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.54,0:15:43.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Captain Eustass Kidd and\NTrafalgar Law are also present.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.20,0:15:45.80,Default,,0,0,0,,With a total of 13 pirates\Nwith bounties confirmed,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.88,0:15:48.18,Default,,0,0,0,,five being rookies\Nworth over $100 million.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.26,0:15:51.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Of them, the key offender\Nappears to be Monkey D.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.10,0:15:53.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Luffy, who assaulted a celestial dragon.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.38,0:15:56.70,Default,,0,0,0,,We've lost all contact with the\Nguards at the human shop, uh,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.78,0:15:58.49,Default,,0,0,0,,I mean the employment office.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.68,0:16:03.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Given the conditions reported from that\Narea, they've most likely been subdued.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.46,0:16:05.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Whatever the case,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.56,0:16:07.64,Default,,0,0,0,,the act of taking three celestial dragons
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.72,0:16:10.66,Default,,0,0,0,,hostage is a vile and\Nunprecedented transgression.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.86,0:16:13.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Have they made any demands? No, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.40,0:16:14.52,Default,,0,0,0,,None at the moment.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.78,0:16:21.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Whatever the case may be, we'll\Nneed to take immediate action.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.02,0:16:25.74,Default,,0,0,0,,After all, the world nobles\Nare the victims here, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.64,0:16:28.92,Default,,0,0,0,,But don't worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.18,0:16:30.88,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll take care of it myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.44,0:16:33.72,Default,,0,0,0,,I won't be gone for long.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.36,0:16:59.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn it, this is no laughing matter.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.06,0:17:04.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Please, I need you, Mr. Doflamingo.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.24,0:17:07.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Roswald and his family are\Ngoing to come after us.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.60,0:17:08.96,Default,,0,0,0,,They'll never stand for this.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.04,0:17:12.92,Default,,0,0,0,,And even worse, our shop's lost\Nevery last bit of its credibility.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.80,0:17:17.54,Default,,0,0,0,,We're ruined. You hear me, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.84,0:17:19.44,Default,,0,0,0,,You've got to take care of this mess.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.52,0:17:20.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh Get a grip.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.96,0:17:25.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Human trafficking is so\Nyesterday's news you fool!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.82,0:17:29.98,Default,,0,0,0,,It's all about the smiles now\Nyou understand. Now listen?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.06,0:17:32.32,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm giving the shop to you disco.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.56,0:17:34.00,Default,,0,0,0,,You're on your own now.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.20,0:17:35.97,Default,,0,0,0,,So don't be calling me anymore
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.90,0:17:42.22,Default,,0,0,0,,What you're just going to abandon\Nme during our worst crisis ever?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.30,0:17:43.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Shut up.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.21,0:17:44.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Geez, you're annoying.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.24,0:17:48.48,Default,,0,0,0,,The hell out of me while you sit there\Nblaming me for your own misfortune!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.56,0:17:51.40,Default,,0,0,0,,A new era continues to draw ever closer.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.48,0:17:53.22,Default,,0,0,0,,I've been ordered.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.30,0:17:57.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, all of us actually have\Nbeen ordered into active duty by
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.66,0:18:04.49,Default,,0,0,0,,the Navy.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.57,0:18:07.17,Default,,0,0,0,,I bet you're wondering\Nwhat's about to happen.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.26,0:18:10.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, let me tell you that.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.48,0:18:14.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Would be the Whitebeard Pirates\Nversus the seven warlords of the sea?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.06,0:18:28.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Everyone, get as far away\Nfrom this area as possible!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.34,0:18:29.60,Default,,0,0,0,,These people are dangerous.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.68,0:18:30.88,Default,,0,0,0,,This is for your own good!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.96,0:18:33.61,Default,,0,0,0,,But the slave I'm on is\Nstill trapped inside.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.48,0:18:42.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Any news?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.56,0:18:43.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Have the mortars arrived yet?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.70,0:18:45.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir, most of them anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.28,0:18:46.82,Default,,0,0,0,,They're being set up as we speak.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.90,0:18:48.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Any updates from HQ?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.68,0:18:53.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Admiral Kizaru's on his way, sir, but\Nthey're bringing in the special vanguard.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.16,0:18:53.99,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.07,0:18:56.30,Default,,0,0,0,,You're kidding me,\Nthey're coming? Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.68,0:18:58.72,Default,,0,0,0,,At least, that's what I was told.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.32,0:19:08.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa, now hold on. Are you crazy?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.74,0:19:09.98,Default,,0,0,0,,You can't, it'll explode.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.06,0:19:11.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, it's true!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.46,0:19:12.84,Default,,0,0,0,,We've seen it happen before!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.92,0:19:13.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.83,0:19:14.66,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll hurt her!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.75,0:19:15.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Bad idea!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.66,0:19:16.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Very bad idea!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.22,0:19:19.66,Default,,0,0,0,,It'll be alright, just don't flinch.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.50,0:19:32.79,Default,,0,0,0,,I have no idea what kind of\Npower that guy used earlier.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.94,0:19:34.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Where's Franky with that key?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.50,0:19:35.40,Default,,0,0,0,,What's he doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.48,0:19:37.26,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm telling you, just wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.46,0:19:38.92,Default,,0,0,0,,This is a big mistake!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.78,0:19:47.96,Default,,0,0,0,,He set it off! It's gonna blow!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.40,0:19:49.86,Default,,0,0,0,,What are we gonna do?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.78,0:19:51.61,Default,,0,0,0,,GAMY!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.76,0:20:02.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't scare me like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.50,0:20:03.97,Default,,0,0,0,,I thought I was too late.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.06,0:20:08.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Went to all the trouble to find the key\Nand you don't even need the damn thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.98,0:20:09.81,Default,,0,0,0,,It's off.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.70,0:20:11.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Kuma!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.46,0:20:18.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Kuma!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.44,0:20:19.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, thank goodness!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.26,0:20:24.24,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.44,0:20:25.50,Default,,0,0,0,,How'd you do that?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.62,0:20:28.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Look, these weren't\Neasy to find, you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.86,0:20:29.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, nicely done.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.08,0:20:31.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Better luck next time, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.86,0:20:32.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Here, carrier.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.44,0:20:35.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Kuma, you're safe now.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.28,0:20:36.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Nothing to worry about.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.36,0:20:37.80,Default,,0,0,0,,How did you...?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.42,0:20:39.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh, thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.14,0:20:43.42,Default,,0,0,0,,What's going on here?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.70,0:20:47.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Look, man, I appreciate the\Nhelp, but seriously, who are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.06,0:20:50.89,Default,,0,0,0,,What the?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.00,0:20:52.22,Default,,0,0,0,,How did he do that?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.74,0:20:55.62,Default,,0,0,0,,That old geezer's got\Nsome kind of freaky power!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.88,0:21:02.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Just who is he anyway?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.58,0:21:04.17,Default,,0,0,0,,And where did he come from?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.14,0:21:08.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, today's your lucky day.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.16,0:21:10.51,Default,,0,0,0,,All the fires took off.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.78,0:21:14.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Unless you like being a slave, I'd\Nget out of here while you still can.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.08,0:21:14.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Boom!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.18,0:21:23.78,Default,,0,0,0,,That geezer took out all these\Nguards at once, like by himself.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.86,0:21:25.54,Default,,0,0,0,,He must know how to use magic.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.62,0:21:26.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe he's a sorcerer.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.06,0:21:28.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, whatever he is, he's powerful.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.96,0:21:31.61,Default,,0,0,0,,And he said something\Nabout Luffy's hat, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.96,0:21:38.40,Default,,0,0,0,,That Straw Hat you wear, it suits a\Nfearless man like yourself quite well.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.82,0:21:40.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, I've wanted to meet you.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.60,0:21:42.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Monkey D. Luffy.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.04,0:21:45.63,Default,,0,0,0,,How do you know him, Luffy?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.74,0:21:47.92,Default,,0,0,0,,I haven't even met him, he just said!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.12,0:21:51.14,Default,,0,0,0,,I think he used something called Haki.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.40,0:21:54.52,Default,,0,0,0,,I've heard of it, but I've\Nnever seen it used before.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.20,0:21:58.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, I'm sorry about that, everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.24,0:22:01.06,Default,,0,0,0,,I didn't realize there were\Nother pirates here as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.14,0:22:05.73,Default,,0,0,0,,You must all be quite strong to withstand\Nsomething like that with no trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.96,0:22:09.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, well, I never expected\Nto meet such a big shot here!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.72,0:22:13.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Dark King Silver's Ray,\Nyou're a legend, old man.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.98,0:22:16.36,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you doing in a place like this?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.58,0:22:19.94,Default,,0,0,0,,On these islands, I'm just\NRay, the coding craftsman.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.02,0:22:22.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't go around calling\Nme that other name.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.66,0:22:23.90,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm retired now.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.98,0:22:26.68,Default,,0,0,0,,I just want a quiet and peaceful life.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.76,0:22:28.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Looks like you'll live, Hachi?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.10,0:22:32.08,Default,,0,0,0,,What did I tell you about\Nwalking around this archipelago?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.16,0:22:33.10,Default,,0,0,0,,You gotta be more careful.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.18,0:22:35.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I know. I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.08,0:22:37.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you, for everything!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.30,0:22:39.48,Default,,0,0,0,,I appreciate you saving my friend here.?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.56,0:22:42.98,Default,,0,0,0,,So what was that about\Nyou wanting to meet me?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.78,0:22:45.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmm, let's save that for later.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.90,0:22:47.40,Default,,0,0,0,,First, we need to get out of here!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.48,0:22:49.82,Default,,0,0,0,,They've got us cornered\Nfrom every angle, boss?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.90,0:22:50.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Got a plan?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.20,0:22:54.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Tested, one, two.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.12,0:22:55.48,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, you criminals!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.56,0:22:57.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Release the Roswa family.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.34,0:22:59.62,Default,,0,0,0,,An admiral will be arriving shortly.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.00,0:23:02.24,Default,,0,0,0,,I recommend you surrender immediately.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.86,0:23:05.98,Default,,0,0,0,,And don't blame us for\Nwhatever happens, you rookies!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.74,0:23:14.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, we're just innocent bystanders.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.14,0:23:16.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Why is the Navy treating\Nus like accomplices?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.70,0:23:20.46,Default,,0,0,0,,On the upside, I got to see Straw\NHat Luffy do something crazy,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.70,0:23:22.05,Default,,0,0,0,,so no complaints there.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.24,0:23:24.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Still, I'd rather avoid\Nfighting an admiral.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.50,0:23:25.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.41,0:23:28.41,Default,,0,0,0,,But if you're expecting me to help,\NI've used my power enough today.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.50,0:23:29.85,Default,,0,0,0,,It's all up to you now.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.10,0:23:33.18,Default,,0,0,0,,It'll be hard for me to stay\Nif the Navy discovers who I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.26,0:23:35.97,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't need a senior\Ncitizen to fight for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.44,0:23:38.36,Default,,0,0,0,,The longer we wait, the worse it'll get.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.44,0:23:39.48,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm out of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.00,0:23:42.41,Default,,0,0,0,,If you babies can't handle a few Marines,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:42.58,0:23:46.52,Default,,0,0,0,,then sit here while I show you how\Na real man takes care of things.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.04,0:23:51.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Look, I already told you,\NI'm gonna do it! Shut up!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.86,0:23:53.40,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna take care of them!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:53.48,0:23:54.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Back off, will ya?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.50,0:23:55.33,Default,,0,0,0,,I said I got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:55.41,0:23:56.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Beat it, you two.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:56.33,0:23:57.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Leave this to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:57.24,0:23:58.07,Default,,0,0,0,,You can't get lost.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.15,0:23:58.98,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.07,0:24:00.62,Default,,0,0,0,,If you hear me, just go back inside.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.70,0:24:02.12,Default,,0,0,0,,You can't tell me what to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:02.20,0:24:03.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Why don't you settle down?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:03.48,0:24:04.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Why don't you get out of my face?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:04.96,0:24:06.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Somebody should muzzle both of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:06.50,0:24:07.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Settle.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:08.68,0:24:09.51,Default,,0,0,0,,All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:09.66,0:24:11.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Go back inside, guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:11.54,0:24:12.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Aren't you listening?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:12.84,0:24:15.10,Default,,0,0,0,,I told you two to go back inside first.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:15.18,0:24:16.01,Default,,0,0,0,,I got this.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:16.09,0:24:17.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Try to boss me around like that again.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:17.96,0:24:20.20,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll be the first when\NI cut down, Eustass.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:20.28,0:24:21.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Get ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:22.34,0:24:24.06,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll handle this by myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:24.66,0:24:27.60,Default,,0,0,0,,All three have bounties\Nway over a hundred million
Dialogue: 0,0:24:28.30,0:24:31.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Do all captains act like children\Nor just those idiots? Hey,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:32.16,0:24:34.46,Default,,0,0,0,,it's gonna get ugly out\Nthere Let's use this
Dialogue: 0,0:24:34.54,0:24:37.54,Default,,0,0,0,,chance to escape waiting\Naround is just plain crazy
Dialogue: 0,0:24:39.58,0:24:40.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Hodgin, thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:41.12,0:24:43.34,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry for causing you so much trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:43.42,0:24:44.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:44.33,0:24:46.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Never mind all that I'm just\Nglad that you're all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:47.02,0:24:47.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Follow them.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:47.93,0:24:51.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Try to break through in one shot\NThat sounds like a plan if we
Dialogue: 0,0:24:51.62,0:24:55.42,Default,,0,0,0,,happen to get separated in the chaos\NLet's meet up at Grove number 13.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:55.50,0:24:56.74,Default,,0,0,0,,I know my way around.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:56.92,0:24:57.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Grove 13, got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:58.06,0:25:00.30,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll be lucky if you find\Nyour way out of the building!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:00.38,0:25:01.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:01.29,0:25:02.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Giant, what about you?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:02.40,0:25:04.92,Default,,0,0,0,,All of us were on the\Nverge of becoming slaves.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:05.00,0:25:07.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Now I'm going to escape\Nsomewhere with them.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:08.00,0:25:08.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Very well.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:08.96,0:25:11.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Try not to draw attention\Nto yourself, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:11.84,0:25:14.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Old man, Straw Hat, and your crew!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:14.54,0:25:17.36,Default,,0,0,0,,I will repay the favor\Nif we ever meet again!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:17.86,0:25:19.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks for everything!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:22.58,0:25:24.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Sure, it was no problem! Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:25.32,0:25:28.42,Default,,0,0,0,,You're taking credit? Mortars! Fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:32.56,0:25:33.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Balloons!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:37.36,0:25:38.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Repel!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:39.74,0:25:40.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Now room.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:41.72,0:25:44.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, what's up with this\Ncircle bubble thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:44.74,0:25:46.14,Default,,0,0,0,,And shambles.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:47.30,0:25:48.64,Default,,0,0,0,,You killed me!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:49.92,0:25:51.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, what?
